From 0465643b699dbe41da5003ac57c939e121ab0bbd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oneshot <oneshot@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:00:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] 0040 android: launcher fits a phone's landscape height

The rail's tabs shrink to the height there is and the version line goes on
short screens, so all seven tabs show; the catalog's header scrolls with the
results there; the catalog and versions screens are full screen like the rest;
sideways rows fade out where more is hidden.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
